    <briefdescription>
<para>Global key registry using data-oriented design (Structure of Arrays). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores all unique keys once with precomputed hashes for O(1) lookups. Keys are referenced by uint16 indices throughout the system. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
